# ==============================================================================================
# MLM Sittu
#
# Two rules are load-bearing and the rest is housekeeping:
#
#   1. `.env` never leaves the machine it was written on. The local one holds development
#      defaults, but the same filename on the server holds the NIC pepper and encryption key,
#      and those cannot be rotated once real identity numbers exist. Ignoring the name rather
#      than the file means a real secret can never be committed by accident.
#   2. `var/` holds uploaded NIC scans and bank slips. They are customer identity documents.
#      A public repository would publish them; a private one would still put them somewhere
#      they were never meant to be.
# ==============================================================================================

# --- Secrets ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Every variant, not just the exact name. Editors leave .env.save, .env.bak, .env.swp and
# .env.orig beside the file they were opened on, and each of those is the whole secret with a
# different suffix — matching only `.env` publishes them the moment somebody runs `git add -A`.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks

# --- Uploaded documents -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# NIC scans and payment slips. In production these live on a Docker volume, not in the tree.
var/

# --- Database dumps ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local backups written by dump-native.ps1 and by hand before a destructive migration. They carry
# real rows — password hashes, encrypted NICs, customer names — and are recreated on demand.
db-snapshot/
*.dump

# --- Java / Gradle ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
.gradle/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
*.log

# --- Node -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.local

# --- Editors and OS ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
out/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
